WEBVTT

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:14.740
Wake up early!!

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:15.240
Wake up early!!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.240
Wake up early!!

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:18.740
Wake up early!!

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:32.590
Brrrr...

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:43.890
All right!

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:51.480
Good luck on your exams today, Sae!

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.190
Here, I made you lunch!

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.070
Thanks, Yuno.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.870
I made something for Hiro.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.950
Thanks, I can't wait to try it.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:03.910
No getting into it before lunchtime.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.460
How would I even do that during a test!?

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:13.510
Do your best! I know you can!

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:15.880
Why are you so nervous, Nazuna?

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.550
Let's get going, Hiro.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.810
Hurray! Hurray!

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:25.640
Sae! Hiro!

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.940
See you!

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:30.440
Here we go.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:46.620
Sae & Hiro
Graduation

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.170
Whistling a tune in the sunshine

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.540
Jamming with the pigeons on the windowsill

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:54.460
Even if I'm a little drowsy

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.090
In my head I'm dancing

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.590
Smiling my way through daily life

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.220
Of course that's how the story goes!

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:07.640
But wait but wait can't forget that dash of spice, out under the blue sky

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:12.900
Where to go? What to say? What's that? Let's give it a try!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.440
That's what this moment so special!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:22.080
The hands of the clock are moving at my pace! (Yay!)

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:26.950
Season by season, brushstroke by brushstroke, relaxed everyday life

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:32.340
Pastel, vivid, metro, my own unique coloring

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:38.720
Sometimes with my heart pounding, drawing a surreal sun,

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:46.470
Grabbing a hold of my artistic spirit!

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:53.560
Like it? Love it love it sketch it!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.030
Paint it all the colors of the rainbow!

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.570
All right, let's go!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.370
I'm back...

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.630
Welcome home!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.460
Hiro?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.010
Did you have trouble with your exams?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.390
The sketch subject...

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.010
It moved...

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:31.940
What, they had you sketching a person or an animal or something and they couldn't stay still?

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.690
No, it was a still life.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.480
Hiro, do you have a fever?

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.530
Is the pressure getting to you?

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:40.740
No!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:48.700
They had the subject on some kind of spinning platform, and it kept turning around and around.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.250
I ended up drawing it with an afterimage,

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.380
but I'm not sure that's what they wanted me to do...

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.380
Yeah, that's a tough one.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.380
Huh, didn't know they could do that.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:03.590
What if you drew speed lines around it, like in a comic?

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.010
These whirly lines?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.010
Yeah.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:12.310
And then you could write something like "*SPIN SPIN*" in big bold letters, like this.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.150
I don't think you're supposed to write it out...

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.530
You have another exam tomorrow, right, Hiro?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.150
I'll make you something for lunch this time!

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.740
I hope you enjoy it…

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.410
Can I say one thing?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:37.920
I'm really, really grateful that you're all making lunches for me.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:43.300
It feels so nice to know that you all care that much.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:49.680
So I hate to say this so much...

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:55.940
But since exams started and you've been feeding me all these cutlets, I've gained like three kilos!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.480
Wait, we all-!?

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.200
I'm back, guys.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.820
Think I knocked that one outta the park!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.200
<i>She's totally different...</i>

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.580
<i>Sae...</i>

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:18.420
I bought some sweets on the way back, want some?

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:24.010
<i>Shouldn't you be watching your weight now, Hiro? </i>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.970
I know you showed me the pamphlets you got,

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.310
but it's really sinking in now just how much of a marathon exams are...

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:39.150
Yeah. Mine are only five days long, but Hiro's are fifteen.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:43.900
Yeah. It's almost like I have an exam month instead.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:48.700
I'm surprised at how little there is to do.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.200
I've even run out of things to try and cram.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.620
All I have left to do is sharpen pencils.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:58.540
Though tonight I might space out and end up sharpening them to stubs…

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.000
That's scary!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.430
Why do we have to take exams, anyway?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.460
What, you don't wanna?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.830
I mean, I get it when I think about it.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.690
It's not like I haven't taken them before...

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.110
Well, is it really something you just do for yourself right then and there?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.450
Or is it something that you do for yourself, and then for the you that you want to be?

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:33.120
Miya, how can you come up with something like that while you sit there clipping your nails?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.580
I guess you're right.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.460
When I was in middle school, I worked hard to get here...

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.590
I'm really glad I did.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.890
Whoops, there goes one!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:52.800
Miya!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.320
Please put down your pencils.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.820
You will have a 50-minute lunch break beginning now.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.530
Practical examinations will begin at 1:05.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.040
Let's go eat, Hiro!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.950
Did your friends make you another lunch?

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.540
I'm jealous. They sound so nice.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:28.340
Wow, it's cute!

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:35.350
Cherry blossom marks made out of sakura denbu, and then... Sausage? Huh?

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:41.810
So you made wieners for Hiro today?

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.360
Yeah, because "wiener" sounds like "winner".

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.480
I wonder if she'll get it?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:52.610
It'd be nice if it cheered her up, but even if it doesn't click it's still a nice light choice.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:57.330
And next I'll make something with chikuwa, like you can look through them and see the light at the end of the tunnel!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:01.960
There's still a long way to go. We shouldn't wear ourselves out yet.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.210
Yeah. It's a marathon, after all.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:09.960
Eating cutlets for Hiro and Sae is good enough!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.090
I wasn't even thinking of that...

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:28.940
"January payment of 2,560 yen received".

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.450
Wrong envelope.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.910
Quit joking around!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:48.170
8236...

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.590
There it is...

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:56.590
Wait, let me double check! 8236.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:59.680
Me too! 8236?

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:00.930
8236!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:08.560
8236... 8236... 8236... 8236... 8236...

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.570
6823?

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.610
Stop that!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.240
That's it.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.200
It's there.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.360
So...

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.620
Clear!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.620
Then...

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:24.750
Huh?

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.000
That means...

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.750
I made it!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.130
Congrats, Sae!

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.840
Congratulations.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.470
Sae?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.720
It still doesn't feel real.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.720
We can fix that!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.980
You made it!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.560
You're in!

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:49.480
Yay, Sae!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.360
If someone told you that you were the new Prime Minister, you wouldn't be able to believe it, right?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.860
Well, no, but...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.280
That'd just be 100% false.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.290
All right, I'm next!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.500
Just a little bit longer!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.870
You still have exams left, right, Hiro?

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.920
Yeah, two to go!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.380
If I get an acceptance letter from where I really want to go, I won't have to take them, though.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.970
Ama Art University, right?

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.630
When will you hear?

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.760
This weekend, so five days from now.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.770
Don't worry. I know you'll make it.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.480
I've just gotta hope for a miracle!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.980
C'mon, guys!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.200
Looks like I made it.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.410
Congratulations!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:52.000
Thanks, but it's still just my #3.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:55.130
That's still amazing! Congrats!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:59.430
The funny thing is, my #4 rejected me.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.390
That's weird.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:06.270
You made it into your #3, but not your #4?

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.180
Art's tough.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.610
I know! The scorer must be bad at drawing!

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.150
<i>That's... an interesting way of looking at it...</i>

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:20.030
I wonder if there's any subjects where you'd do best handing in a blank sheet?

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:24.450
That'd be a pretty abstract exam topic.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.890
How'd you do, Hiro?

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:48.850
I'm... waitlisted...

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.940
Miya, what's "waitlisted" mean?

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:56.400
I think it means she's, like, a benchwarmer.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.110
I don't get it.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:06.740
"Waitlisted" means I'll be accepted if not enough of the students who were accepted decide to attend.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:12.540
Lots of art students apply to many different schools. I'm not the only one.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.250
So they tend to end up accepting a lot of waitlisted students.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.500
Oh, I see.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:22.340
So can we celebrate now, or does it have to wait?

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.260
Not quite yet.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:27.720
They say they'll send a special letter by courier next week to let me know if a spot opened up.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:30.140
This is gonna be one nervous week.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.730
Silly Miya...

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.150
Sorry.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.030
We've just gotta hope for a miracle!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.620
Come on!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.010
I can't relax...

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.140
It's like I'm on tenterhooks.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.100
Maybe if we just take a deep breath...

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.640
Good idea!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.650
What's up?

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.740
You came out because you heard that bike?

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.410
Yeah. We thought...

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.290
Sorry I have you on edge like that.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.370
Don't worry about it!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.160
I hope it comes soon...

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.170
Domiso's!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.470
Nori!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.010
My bad.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.600
Sorry about the timing.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.680
You ordered pizza for lunch?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.980
Whoa, living it up!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.600
Well, uh....

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.870
Delivery for apartment 101.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.790
Thank you!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:14.910
Uh, sure...

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.500
I can't make myself open it in front of everyone...

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.130
Let me look at it alone...

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.620
Sae, Hiro, congrats on passing your exams!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.920
Cheers!

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.840
Cheers!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.670
So you ordered this pizza to celebrate?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:13.970
To be honest, I ordered dinner online, but I forgot to put a time in and they brought it right away.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:19.980
I don't know if I can even eat this with all the butterflies in my stomach...

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.100
You don't have to finish it.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:32.700
It still doesn't feel real to me at all.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:36.030
I guess we don't have to study anymore, right?

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.500
Yeah.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.830
That's such a weight off my shoulders!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:45.630
I've been holding back so much, but now I can finally have some fun!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.960
I have a question for you two, then!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.470
What's the number-one thing you want to do right now?

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.390
The number-one thing? Hmm...

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.180
There's a couple movies I wanted to see.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.850
I want to go shopping and have some fun at karaoke too.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:03.520
Sure. Let's do it all.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:06.270
But she asked for the number-one thing, and those aren't it.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.610
Oh, right. That.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.610
A good night's sleep!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.610
You'll finally be able to get some rest tonight.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:14.620
Yeah!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:18.540
And how do you expect to adjust to life on campus?

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:20.750
Life on campus, huh?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:25.420
Oh, right! In college you don't have to wear uniforms.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.420
You can dress however you want!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:31.720
Yeah, but that means you have to worry about what to put on every day.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.970
Are you going to get a job?

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:38.930
Well, I write, so that's a job in itself.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.220
I guess.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:42.560
I'd like to try something.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.940
I think it would be educational.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.940
You should deliver papers!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.270
Newspaper delivery?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:52.030
A sleepyhead like Hiro could never do that.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.280
She'd have to find an evening paper.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.450
You meanie!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.320
How about a patisserie?

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.910
If you work at a patisserie, do you get to take home the leftover cakes?

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:07.710
Yeah. Restaurants usually give you leftovers and even feed you when you're there.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.590
Three square and a paycheck. What a deal!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.130
Just a second.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.220
Hel-

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.970
Hi sis!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.060
Did Hiro get her results!?

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.480
Quiet down! You're yelling.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.020
Must be from Chika.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.190
Hiro got accepted.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.940
Really!? That's great!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.030
Guess I'll let her annoy you for a while.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.240
Hi, Chika?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.030
This is Hiro.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:42.120
Hiro? Congrats on getting accepted!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:45.830
Thanks for thinking of me.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.710
Can I come over sometime and help celebrate?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:50.920
Sure thing!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:54.760
I can't wait to have your cooking!

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.050
Since it's a party, what's on the menu?

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.090
How about chirashizushi?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:01.470
It's Hiro's party. Why should she have to cook?

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:05.230
I'll be sure to have some ready for you.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.310
Here, Sae.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:07.890
Hi.

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:12.520
Hear that, sis? I'll be over soon!

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.480
Sure, fine.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:20.660
And listen up! This time you're really going to be living alone, so Hiro won't be able to cook for you anymore!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.540
You need to at least learn how to make rice!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.910
I can too cook rice!

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:29.540
Anyway, I'm out. Say hi to everyone for me! Bye-bye!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.540
See you.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.170
Jeez...

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:36.510
I'm happy she called just to find out how I did.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.300
That was great.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:45.520
Absolutely scrumptious.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:49.190
Sae, Hiro, are you full?

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.770
I couldn't eat another bite.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.440
I wanted that more than I thought.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.570
It was really satisfying, thanks.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.610
That's great.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:07.410
Thanks to all of you, we managed to get accepted to college.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:13.170
There's no way we could possibly thank you enough.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:19.550
Those cutlet lunches every day gave us plenty of luck.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.220
I'm glad to hear that.

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.720
Right, Nazuna?

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.810
Yeah, they worked hard.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.560
They definitely did their job here.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.940
Miya!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:42.950
Just watching you work so hard and worry so much

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:46.450
made us know we had to do something to help out.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.830
I guess the Hidamari Cheer Squad was a good idea.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:56.340
It's like we all went through it together.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:20:00.300
There were nights where I was too nervous to sleep,

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.840
but knowing I wasn't alone helped me so much.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.340
Hiro...

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:08.220
And with that, the Hidamari Cheer Squad's mission is complete!

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:11.890
Now, then. Lend me your hands!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.770
All right!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.280
Until next time!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.040
I haven't been able to relax like this in a long time.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.040
Me too.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:42.010
I was on edge until you got your acceptance.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.590
You made it so early!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:47.140
Sorry I kept you hanging.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:53.310
I'm really glad that we both made it into our first choices.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.900
We worked hard.

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.030
Good job.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:06.530
You too, Sae.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:15.250
I'm not sure if it took forever, or if it was over in the blink of an eye.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:15.920
Yeah.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:20.170
There's so much we have to focus on now, too.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:23.550
Let's not worry about that today.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:24.930
Yeah.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:27.800
Tomorrow's another day.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:28.300
Right?

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:29.850
You're still not full!?

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.070
No one said anything about it, but...

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:52.200
Once they graduate, they have to leave Hidamari Apartments...

00:21:56.500 --> 00:22:00.210
I don't know if I can keep smiling when I say goodbye...

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:20.770
Light of the bright rising sun, strong enough to carry me away

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:23.980
Wake me up out of this sleep

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:31.530
Feeling those warm beams falling on me, today I'm gonna soar

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:35.330
Beyond the horizon of my heart

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:39.920
The vapor trails soar through the heavens

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:45.670
Drawing a story still just halfway done

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:53.050
In my heart it's still going on

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:58.560
The day we meet is still so far away, so far I can barely see it

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:03.860
Somewhere in this canvas I'm boldly laying out

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.240
My heart and body swing in the balance

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:14.490
What dreams will this new art bring me?

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:20.290
I can still feel it, even here

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:27.210
Pulling at me

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:35.930
Where will I find that dream cloud?

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:41.900
One, two...

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:43.520
Sae! Hiro!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.310
Congratulations on-

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:45.230
On-

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:47.280
Gradually!

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:48.610
Sorry.

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:50.240
Miyako!

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.700
All right, one more time!

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:52.760
One, two...

00:23:52.760 --> 00:23:54.280
Sae! Hiro!

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:55.030
Congratulations on-

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:56.280
On-

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:58.200
Gradually!

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:59.620
Nazuna?

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:05.210
Next time, "February 28th-March 1st, Graduation Sketch".

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:09.210
We'll be waiting at Hidamari Apartments. Be sure to come see us!
